        "TileImage": "$($repository 881fde89-e112-4e1d-a05b-7fbf2fab2213).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour next assignment takes you to Paris. Our client — an undisclosed board member of an international conglomerate — has contracted the ICA to remove three individuals who are part of &quot;The Evil Three&quot;\r\rYour primary targets are:\r\rOlivier Assis, the leader.\r\rKurt Donovan, the bodyguard.\r\rJustin Mills, the chef.\r\rThe three men are attending the Sanguine Fashion show. Security is tight, but the event’s emphasis on privacy means no outside law enforcement.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
